472540aa66b6c315be6a23f0dc91e6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eKÍCH THƯỚC SẢN PHẨM\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e0/7e/a6/d430990655f965cc420185fe3c580d48.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eTHÔNG SỐ SẢN PHẨM\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/11/68/79/622ca3dbcd0b04b4492eb70e6bf39baa.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eCHI TIẾT SẢN PHẨM\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/94/38/0e/2cb1ecafac72433f4b00520b23ee68fc.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eVới số lượng thanh phơi lớn, khả năng phơi đa dạng. Đáp ứng đủ nhu cầu phơi đồ hằng ngày của 1 gia đình bình thường.\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/6c/ed/69/f7ee54666f60df5385b87112cfdb2cb7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eCó thể điều chỉnh góc độ mâm phơi để đón được lượng ánh sáng lớn nhất giúp đồ mau khô.\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/a5/ee/4b/d204fcdbbe90ef3ba042b568aece6a62.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eDễ dàng sử dụng với cơ chế gấp đơn giãn, thích hợp với mọi lứa tuổi\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/24/56/e6/fa28452e32db31b0f7d387ed15d60cc3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003eĐược chế tạo từ vật liệu Inox-304 cao cấp cho màu sắc luôn sáng bóng theo thời gian.\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/a8/2f/a5/aeed06bab10e06d25a7a0dfdc27f4146.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/68/36/27/3f7db3493f24d6d115cc50f929c170f2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eChịu được tải trọng cao không lo về vấn đề phơi chăn, đệm\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/a6/c4/bb/2c5ce2cd2703ad4633864091179c72aa.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eThiết kế hiện đại năng động, rất thích hợp với đời sống hiện đại ngày nay.\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/8f/c5/27/bf987bb35135bbf632ce5c09f129bd68.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\